<title>USA: Ciber comfortable with Q4 EPS estimates.</title>
<headline>Ciber comfortable with Q4 EPS estimates.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ciber Inc said Thursday it is comfortable with analysts' consensus fiscal fourth quarter estimates for earnings per share and revenues.</p>
<p>Analysts predict earnings of $0.26 per share for the quarter, according to First Call, up from the $0.14 per share, on a pro forma basis, reported for the same period last year.</p>
